1️⃣ AWS SSM Parameter Store (What & Why)
What it is
AWS Systems Manager Parameter Store is a key-value store used to keep:

Configuration values

Environment variables

Some secrets (passwords, tokens)

Typical DevOps usage
Store non-sensitive config (DB URL, feature flags)

Store simple secrets (if rotation not required)

Pass parameters to:

EC2

ECS

EKS

Lambda

CI/CD pipelines (Jenkins, GitHub Actions)

Parameter types
Type	Meaning
String	Plain text
StringList	Comma-separated values
SecureString	Encrypted using KMS
