2️⃣ AWS Secrets Manager (What & Why)
What it is
AWS Secrets Manager is purpose-built for secrets that require:

Strong security

Automatic rotation

Auditing

Typical DevOps usage
Database passwords

API keys

OAuth tokens

Third-party credentials

Key features
Automatic secret rotation

Native integration with:

RDS

Aurora

Redshift

Lambda

Versioning of secrets

Fine-grained access control

Example secret
